  1600	    transcript is missing/tampered/replayed is rejected outright (the label
  1601	    must never be a lie); with require_captured, a self-attested verdict also
  1602	    fails — captured OR attached both satisfy it (each carries a committed,
  1603	    hash-bound transcript; the honest difference is documented in GATE.md)."""
