  1666	    # so a hand-forged `{"command":"echo fake","status":"pass"}` (or an old
  1667	    # command from before config changed) can't gate green. FAIL CLOSED when the
  1668	    # config has no test_command — an empty/None command can never be a match, so
  1669	    # a forged pass can't ride on a repo that never configured its tests.
  1670	    cfg_cmd = str(test_command or "").strip()
